#: Settings.ui.h:1
msgid ""
"When set to minimize, double clicking minimizes all the windows of the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingesteld op minimaliseren, zal dubbelklikken alle vensters van de "
"toepassing minimaliseren."

#: Settings.ui.h:2
msgid "Shift+Click action"
msgstr "Shift+klikken-actie"

#: Settings.ui.h:3
msgid "Raise window"
msgstr "Venster naar voren halen"

#: Settings.ui.h:4
msgid "Minimize window"
msgstr "Venster minimaliseren"

#: Settings.ui.h:5
